1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:05,558
Terrasight is an AI assistant for farmers. Each morning it says what to do, and why.

2
00:00:05,708 --> 00:00:09,179
Add a field: it reads forty-five years of NASA weather.

3
00:00:09,329 --> 00:00:13,212
It shows how the climate has shifted: first frost, nine days later.

4
00:00:13,362 --> 00:00:16,568
It plans five seasons: thirty-two dollars more per acre.

5
00:00:17,162 --> 00:00:20,383
Ask it anything. Every number is checked against the models.

6
00:00:21,362 --> 00:00:25,392
It also shows where it was wrong: four years missed out of ten.

7
00:00:25,612 --> 00:00:29,476
Built on NASA data, for farms adapting to a changing climate.
